  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Gu Yue Chi Lian groups it with the Liquor worm and boar Gu as extremely rare rank one Gu. Once they appear on the market they are snatched up immediately.",
        "chapters": [
          50
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_chi_lian",
          "gu_liquor_worm"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "If Fang Yuan had a Bookworm, he could feed a map to it and recall that map clearly forever, as long as he did not lose the Gu. Its value sits close to the Liquor worm and White Boar Gu. All three are rare rank one species, expensive on the market, and often sold out in moments.",
        "chapters": [
          71
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "prior-life-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_white_boar_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In his previous life Fang Yuan did not obtain the Liquor worm or White Boar Gu. He accidentally obtained a Bookworm. That copy advanced ranks with him and accompanied him for sixty years. In the current life he craves another, then sets the wish aside because Bookworms are rare and low in number.",
        "chapters": [
          71
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "prior-life-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After killing the demonic Gu Master Chen Cui Hua, Fang Yuan finds a Bookworm in her smashed brain matter. Bai Ning Bing’s attack has already killed it. Fang Yuan judges that this Bookworm was the inheritance item whose information taught her about Gu Masters, including secret recipes.",
        "chapters": [
          211
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "inheritance-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master",
          "char_chen_cui_hua",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In a later Ren Zu telling, an inkman elder says there are many bookworms on Book Mountain that record knowledge left by inkman seniors. Ren Zu gathers those bookworms for information, then with cognition Gu refines more knowledge from them.",
        "chapters": [
          2161
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ren-zus-knowledge-gathering",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ren_zu",
          "loc_book_mountain",
          "gu_cognition_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
